<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42122" root="وعد" body-key="w">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوْعُودٌ</span></b>  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوْعُودَةٌ</span>: see 1, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَعْدٌ</span> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اليَوْمُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الموعود</span> [<i>The promised day;</i> meaning] <i>the day
of resurrection.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعْهُودٌ وَمَشْهُودٌ وَمَوْعُودٌ</span>
<i>Past and present and future:</i> the tenses of a
verb. (Kh, in L, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عهد</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوْعُودٌ</span> is one of
the inf. ns. which have pls. governing as verbs;
its pl. being <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوَاعِيدُ</span>.
Ex. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوَاعِيدَ عُرْقوب أَخَاهُ بِيَثْرِبَ</span>
[<i>As 'Orkoob's promisings of his brother in
Yethrib.</i>] (IJ, ISd.) See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُرْقُوبٌ</span>.

